5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Welcome, everyone. To ensure we make a wise choice, I would like to look into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think it would be helpful to check the capital budget and software allowance, and maybe the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about network coverage at customer plants and in-house developer availability! Let's see if we can actually build these things!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records to understand the actual operational losses.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the staffing of the coordination group and the handling of vendor queries to assess the current human resource burden.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of interests. Does anyone feel we are overlooking a critical angle, or are we satisfied with these ten points of inquiry?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think... we've covered a lot. I'm okay with this list.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm super excited! I think we've got all the bases covered. Let's get to the digging!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The current selection is logical. It balances financial constraints, technical feasibility, historical performance, and operational pain points. I have no further additions.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. The distribution of research is sufficient for an initial assessment. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we are all in agreement, I shall say ""Over"" for this round and await the findings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll say ""Over"" too.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
