58,3,1,talk,Servas,,"We have four candidates: the Supplier Data Hub, Workflow Assistant, Training Studio, and Field Service App. Given our findings, the Supplier Data Hub seems most aligned with reducing the data duplication Ryuji and Asuka noted.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. The Supplier Data Hub sounds like it would fix the address issues and vendor queries, and it might fit the software allowance better than a big new app.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what about the Field Service App? But then I remembered the network coverage is terrible at the plants, so that's probably a no-go. The Data Hub sounds much safer!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,The Supplier Data Hub directly addresses the misrouted deliveries and the time lost to copying records. It targets the root cause of our operational waste without requiring the field connectivity that the app would need.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The Supplier Data Hub would alleviate the burden on the clerks and the coordination group by centralizing records, and it avoids the staffing risks associated with the other more complex tools.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such alignment. The Supplier Data Hub is a focused tool, and as I noted earlier, narrow tools for specific needs are the ones that truly endure in this company.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I just hope the licensing doesn't scale per-head too aggressively, but compared to the others, it seems like the most responsible choice for our budget.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"It's way better than the Workflow Assistant, right? That sounds like it would need everyone to use it every day, and Servas said those are the ones that usually fail!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. The Workflow Assistant would likely become another failed rollout due to its broad scope. The Supplier Data Hub is a targeted solution for a specific, measurable problem.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I concur. The Training Studio also seems too resource-intensive to produce and maintain given our current staffing freeze and developer unavailability. The Data Hub is the only logical choice.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Servas,,I believe we have conducted a thorough analysis. The Supplier Data Hub addresses our operational failures while respecting our resource limitations. I am satisfied with this conclusion.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It seems like the safest and most helpful option for everyone involved. I'm happy to support it.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm all in for the Supplier Data Hub! It's the only one that doesn't sound like a total disaster waiting to happen!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I have no reason to object. The evidence points to the Supplier Data Hub as the most efficient and sustainable use of the innovation fund.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. It is the only proposal that logically addresses our administrative bottlenecks without creating new, unsustainable burdens on our staff.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Servas,,Then let us proceed to the vote. I cast my vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for the Supplier Data Hub as well.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Supplier Data Hub for me too!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I also vote for the Supplier Data Hub.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
